  <section style="background:var(--navy);padding:2rem 0;">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <h3 style="color:#ffffff;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Need a gas safety certificate in St Helens today?</h3>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Same-day CP12 inspections across WA10, WA11 and WA12. Boilers, gas cookers and hobs covered. £80 fixed price. Certificate emailed same day.</p>
      <a href="tel:0151 558 0334" class="btn btn-orange btn-lg" style="box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(249,115,22,0.4);color:#ffffff;">CALL 0151 558 0334</a>
